'''Garb of the Ephemeral''' is a [[synthesised]] [[unique]] {{il|Savant's Robe}}. It always drops with one to three random [[synthesised implicit modifier]]s.

==Mechanics==
{{c|mod|Nearby Allies' Action Speed cannot be modified to below Base Value}}: [[Allies]] within 5 metres of the character cannot have their [[action speed]] modified to below base value.

{{c|mod|Nearby Enemies cannot deal Critical Strikes}}: Enemies within 6 metres of the character cannot deal [[critical strike]]s.

===Divinity===
{{stl|Divinity}}: {{c|help|You are larger, deal more Elemental Damage, take less Elemental Damage and are immune to Curses.}}

Divinity is a [[buff]] that is granted upon reaching 10 Divine Charges. The buff grants 75% more Elemental Damage, 25% less Elemental Damage taken, and Immune to Curses, and lasts 10 seconds.

===Divine Charge===
[[Divine Charge]] - You do not gain Divine Charges while Divinity is active on you. You can gain maximum of 1 charge per second. Once the maximum number of divine charges is gained, Divinity is granted for 10 seconds. Divine charges cannot be gained during Divinity. Garb of the Ephemeral is the only source of divine charges.

