==Version history==
During [[Synthesis league]], Garb of the Ephemeral dropped as a [[fractured item]] from the [[Venarius]] boss encounter in the [[Cortex]] distant memory. A synthesised Garb of the Ephemeral could be created using the [[Synthesiser]].

{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.29.0|
* Non-Unique Synthesised Items can no longer be obtained, except through Corrupting Synthesis Unique Items to be Rare items.
* The [[Beastcrafting|Bestiary Craft]] to Reroll a Synthesis Implicit Modifier on an item can now only be applied to Unique items.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.26.0|
* The {{stl|Divinity}} Buff granted by the Garb of the Ephemeral Unique Body Armour now grants 75% more Elemental Damage (previously 50%) and 25% less Elemental Damage taken (previously 20%).
}}
